cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Si vous utilisez Galaxy dans un travail pédagogique ou scientifique, merci de le citer
  ainsi. If you use Galaxy in teaching or research, please cite it as below.
title: 'Galaxy: 3D Solar System'
abstract: >-
  Interactive real-time 3D solar system visualizer. Positions from astronomy-engine and
  NASA/JPL Horizons ephemerides, Keplerian and hyperbolic propagation for small bodies and
  interstellar objects, compressed and true-scale modes, time travel, scientific shape models.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Adrian
    family-names: Guichard
repository-code: 'https://github.com/Addey34/galaxy-3d'
url: 'https://galaxy.adrianguichard.dev/'
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
version: 0.9.0
keywords:
  - solar system
  - ephemeris
  - JPL Horizons
  - Three.js
  - WebGL
  - astronomy education
